# Orchestrator runtime output (per-job logs and live status files) --
# ephemeral, regenerated on every run, analogous to training_runs/. Matches
# both the old bare names (orchestrator_status.json) and the config-stem-keyed
# names default_paths() now produces (orchestrator_status_q6_jobs.json,
# orchestrator_logs_q6_jobs_v2/) so a second config's defaults aren't
# accidentally left trackable.
orchestrator/*logs*/
orchestrator/*status*.json
orchestrator/*status*.tmp

# Node.js
node_modules/

